<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A1.F7.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 7</span>: </span><span id="A1.F7.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">The required modifications to the training loop of an autoregressive model. We first change how the attention mask is computed, then mask a portion of the input tokens. The block-length is chosen randomly.</span></figcaption>
