<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A1.F8.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 8</span>: </span><span id="A1.F8.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Training a hybrid model for block of size <math id="A1.F8.m37" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=4" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=4</annotation></semantics></math>. We show input tokens (left column), target tokens used for Cross-Entropy loss (second columns) and attention matrix. </span></figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A1.F9" class="ltx_figure">
<div id="A1.F9.3" class="ltx_listing ltx_lstlisting ltx_align_center ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx45" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="lstnumberx45.1" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">from</span><span id="lstnumberx45.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx45.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">torch</span>.<span id="lstnumberx45.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">nn</span>.<span id="lstnumberx45.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">attention</span>.<span id="lstnumberx45.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">flex_attention</span><span id="lstnumberx45.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx45.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">import</span><span id="lstnumberx45.9" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx45.10" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">BlockMask</span>,<span id="lstnumberx45.11" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space"> </span><span id="lstnumberx45.12" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier">create_block_mask</span>
</div>
